# @APP_NAME@ FluentQt integration slice

This starter provides a bounded `WorkspacePanel` target for an existing Qt
Widgets application. Add this directory with `add_subdirectory`, then link
`@APP_TARGET@_workspace_panel` to the host executable.

To build the included demo against a FluentQt checkout:

```bash
cmake -S . -B build -DFLUENTQT_SOURCE_DIR=/path/to/Fluent-QT
cmake --build build --parallel
ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure
```

Application text stays in `application`; FluentQt construction stays in `ui`.
Move the slice into matching host layers instead of creating a second app
architecture beside the existing one.
